    <item>
      <title>End of Module Review</title>
      <link>https://curriculum.codeyourfuture.io/itp/data-groups/success/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://curriculum.codeyourfuture.io/itp/data-groups/success/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;-youve-achieved-your-learning-objectives-if-you-can&#34;&gt;🎯 You&amp;rsquo;ve achieved your learning objectives if you can:&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;ul class=&#34;c-objectives__list&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;li class=&#34;c-objectives__item&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;label&#xD;&#xA;        &gt;&lt;input&#xD;&#xA;          type=&#34;checkbox&#34; /&gt;Store data in arrays and objects in JavaScript.&lt;/label&#xD;&#xA;      &gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;li class=&#34;c-objectives__item&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;label&#xD;&#xA;        &gt;&lt;input&#xD;&#xA;          type=&#34;checkbox&#34; /&gt;Access and manipulate data stored in arrays, objects and query parameters.&lt;/label&#xD;&#xA;      &gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;li class=&#34;c-objectives__item&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;label&#xD;&#xA;        &gt;&lt;input&#xD;&#xA;          type=&#34;checkbox&#34; /&gt;Compare different data types and explain the advantages and limitations of each.&lt;/label&#xD;&#xA;      &gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;li class=&#34;c-objectives__item&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;label&#xD;&#xA;        &gt;&lt;input&#xD;&#xA;          type=&#34;checkbox&#34; /&gt;Access and manipulate a page using the DOM API.&lt;/label&#xD;&#xA;      &gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div id=&#34;announcer&#34; aria-live=&#34;polite&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;-to-complete-_any_-module-you-must&#34;&gt;💯 To complete &lt;em&gt;any&lt;/em&gt; module, you must:&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;ul class=&#34;c-objectives__list&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;li class=&#34;c-objectives__item&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;label&#xD;&#xA;        &gt;&lt;input&#xD;&#xA;          type=&#34;checkbox&#34; /&gt;Do your work: complete all mandatory backlog issues&lt;/label&#xD;&#xA;      &gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;li class=&#34;c-objectives__item&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;label&#xD;&#xA;        &gt;&lt;input&#xD;&#xA;          type=&#34;checkbox&#34; /&gt;Come to class&lt;/label&#xD;&#xA;      &gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div id=&#34;announcer&#34; aria-live=&#34;polite&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-to-complete-_this_-module-you-must&#34;&gt;✅ To complete &lt;em&gt;this&lt;/em&gt; module, you must:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Make a new issue on your own Coursework Planner.&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Follow this template for naming your issue: &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;COHORT_NAME&amp;gt; | Data groups | &amp;lt;YOUR_NAME&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;On the issue, add:&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A link to the &lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://codeyourfuture.github.io/Codewars-Progress-Checker/&#34;&gt;Codewars Progress Checker&lt;/a&gt; showing you have completed &lt;strong&gt;all katas&lt;/strong&gt; from across the Data Groups CodeWars Collections for &lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Data-Groups/issues/936&#34;&gt;sprint 1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Data-Groups/issues/937&#34;&gt;sprint 2&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Data-Groups/issues/938&#34;&gt;sprint 3&lt;/a&gt;.&#xA;Remember: you are also expected to have completed &lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Data-Groups/issues/38&#34;&gt;at least one mentored pair programming session&lt;/a&gt; on this work too.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A link to your &lt;em&gt;completed&lt;/em&gt; pull request for &amp;ldquo;&lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Data-Groups/issues/26&#34;&gt;Alarm Clock App&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A link to your &lt;em&gt;completed&lt;/em&gt; pull request for &amp;ldquo;&lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Data-Groups/issues/14&#34;&gt;Sprint 2 Coursework&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A link to your &lt;em&gt;completed&lt;/em&gt; pull request for &amp;ldquo;&lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Data-Groups/issues/20&#34;&gt;Quote Generator App&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A link to your &amp;ldquo;&lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Data-Groups/issues/10&#34;&gt;Brag Diary&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rdquo;. (It&amp;rsquo;s ok if this is a private document, you don&amp;rsquo;t need to share it if you don&amp;rsquo;t want to, but please include the link for your own reference).&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;An explanation of how you have used your &amp;ldquo;&lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Data-Groups/issues/10&#34;&gt;Brag Diary&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rdquo; to record your progress.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A screenshot showing that you &lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Data-Groups/issues/794&#34;&gt;gave a demo in a demo session with particular members of staff present&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;This must be at a different demo session than any submitted for previous modules.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Submit the issue link to step 3 of ITP on &lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://application-process.codeyourfuture.io/&#34;&gt;CYF Course Portal&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;section class=&#34;c-note c-note--note&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h4 class=&#34;c-note__title&#34;&gt;📝Note&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;c-note__text&#34;&gt;&lt;p&gt;A pull request is &lt;em&gt;completed&lt;/em&gt; when a volunteer has added the &amp;ldquo;Complete&amp;rdquo; tag. If nobody has reviewed your PR after one week, please ask on Slack in #cyf-code-review.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
